OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court charged with murder
OL,4,Aover north Belfast shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 41-year-old man has appeared in court
OL,7,Fcharged with the murder of Robbie
OL,8,FLawlor, who was shot dead in north
OL,9,FBelfast in April 2020.
OL,11,FLawlor, 36, who was from Dublin, was
OL,12,Fshot multiple times outside a house in
OL,13,FEtna Drive in Ardoyne.
OL,15,FPaul Drew, with an address in
OL,16,FWhitebrook Park, Tallaght, Dublin, has
OL,17,Falso been charged with possession of a
OL,18,Ffirearm or ammunition with intent to
OL,19,Fendanger life or cause serious damage
OL,20,Fto property. He was arrested in
OL,21,FLiverpool on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
