OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court charged with murder
OL,4,Aover north Belfast shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Belfast Magistrates' Court on
OL,7,FFriday, Drew spoke only to confirm he
OL,8,Funderstood the charges against him.
